  "notes": [
    "Do not equate Included with graded reasoning. Boolean, budget, fixed mandatory reasoning, and undeclared controls must not acquire invented native effort levels.",
    "nativeEfforts contains the exact declared controls, including an explicit none token where advertised; pickerEfforts omits none and may include separately configured synthetic Codex ultra.",
    "Unknown relay controls mean no declared graded contract through that provider, not that the upstream model cannot reason.",
    "The generic relay fixture hosts are reserved example domains and contain no credentials or private transport settings.",
    "Relay GPT expectations exercise the existing built-in model fallback, not authenticated endpoint verification. Official rows use canonical saved contracts; Sublyx uses maintained contracts. Public OpenRouter metadata is not a successful inference probe.",
    "Sublyx Terra/Astra/Luna Max expectations incorporate the incoming November 13 provider-scoped accepted-and-echoed evidence. This does not change unknown GPT contracts or equate native Max with synthetic Ultra or measured quality."
  ],
